    "answer": "下面给你的是 **batch integration** 的可直接运行 Python 配方，不再只是内部节点清单。\n\n- 当前是 **dry-run workflow 导出**；ExecutionRequest：`0`，本次回答不会运行你的数据。\n- 工具：**Harmony**；运行环境：`sckg-batch-cpu`。\n- 验证状态：**配方已版本化，但当前摘要未匹配 smoke 记录**；demo 只证明代码和产物链可运行，不代表真实生物学准确率。\n- 输入要求：\n\n  - AnnData .h5ad with at least two batches in --batch-key\n  - Declare whether the selected matrix is raw_counts or log_normalized\n  - Use a batch variable that represents technical rather than biological variation\n### 先跑内置模拟数据\n```bash\nconda run -n sckg-batch-cpu python examples/workflows/harmony_batch_integration_workflow.py --demo --output harmony_demo_results\n```\n\n### 换成你的数据\n```bash\nconda run -n sckg-batch-cpu python examples/workflows/harmony_batch_integration_workflow.py --input your_pbmc.h5ad --batch-key batch --matrix-state raw_counts --output harmony_results\n```\n将 `batch` 换成实际技术批次列；如果输入已经 log-normalized，请把 `--matrix-state` 改为 `log_normalized`。\n\n### 会得到什么\n- `integrated_embedding.tsv`\n- `harmony_integrated.h5ad`\n- `batch_mixing_before_after.png`\n- `workflow_summary.json`\n\n### 完整脚本 · smoke 待验证\n完整 Python 配方显示在下方的脚本面板中；请结合上面的实际验证状态使用。\n\n### 使用前必须理解的限制\n- Improved batch mixing must not be accepted if biological separation collapses.\n- Harmony corrects an embedding and does not create corrected count values.\n- The demo smoke is an engineering check, not biological validation.\n- 这是一份已审核的固定配方导出，不是 LLM 任意生成代码；在 scKG 内真实运行仍需数据授权、plan-specific approval 和 execution gate。\n\n### 参考资料\n[1] Harmony · Fast, sensitive, and accurate integration of single cell data with Harmony · page:15;section:Umap 1;paragraph:27\n[2] Harmony · Harmony official GitHub README · section:Standalone Mode;paragraph:12-23\n[3] Harmony · Fast, sensitive, and accurate integration of single cell data with Harmony · page:7;section:C D;paragraph:11",
